      "allergenNote": "Dairy: the polenta comes off or swaps to a dairy-free starch. Allium: the demi glace is built on onions and the charred spring onions sit on top — the kitchen can sub out the spring onions and the demi entirely, or the guest can keep the demi if cooked-in allium works. UNCONFIRMED — MUSTARD: apricot mostarda is made with mustard essence/oil; we don't track mustard as a chip, but flag it for any mustard-allergic guest and confirm with the kitchen.",
